{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa6.u01",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa6.u01",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "33f6d26a6bea7b105b227a474178316bf8d1c2f773f5e5be1603d168fe018ae7",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l01",
      "sha256": "a6fd79e18e2c4cabea8191e76beb8868aa7b45a84fe628d0e06d621e7b623a12"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l02",
      "sha256": "b81fb454d04992a7eb2c4ec3d555dc433b8489c18fb3a7c933ab841beca6adf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l03",
      "sha256": "4535dfad7e1f7de56cea2dcb678f803f3fec4aee4c1ba3076405aad05191d4b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l04",
      "sha256": "2d4b7b82c1df459e678b81494f2437b6ad4a71e624ddb5c75958fbd39dcc90cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l05",
      "sha256": "252a5fdf378b1366b268fb4155d6cc0a136516b671898cdcededc004d34a114d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u01.l06",
      "sha256": "511b2abcc02a1bd448258d2d6d8756aa9d88d2e873cfcf6a47529e8400ac56b3"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "0a36415fce4a0704ce4611f99b0db986c4acdda4d6c3214d7585e888e3f361bc",
      "text": "ulasan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f8f9f7038b0f09c732c42c550a5cf34733ca2cf193489248c7e57b47071be01",
      "text": "Maaf! Maksud saya, enak sekali. Saya belum paham makna tersiratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0fc28fa39f6809def9fefd1ced60a42cb673b6fbb08ab0d94dec4e4ba5abc31f",
      "text": "Gaya bahasanya sederhana, tetapi akhirnya sangat menyentuh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "107ea1a414cbba04bb3345b13db7d948a2ac32133785d565e9c30c1a11100b9d",
      "text": "Cerpen ini punya akhir terbuka, jadi setiap pembaca menafsirkannya sendiri.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "19134101afbecb7442ba676dbfa7a1ea4df61462e3ff7e9ed1ee42772b832fce",
      "text": "terserah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1963874752a1671de6d2f34618d0f3da83ae27defb2ba635d8e38a222cbd43f0",
      "text": "tersurat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1ba44d36604ce941f429e8b1cdfba36a7131b0f706b5c8cb3f6b127db64dc19d",
      "text": "Anak itu merantau karena ada konflik dengan ayahnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "207b8a0575e7ff8c4beab7a2e16197b2ea74e709fecc49ac52f5121f82363fcd",
      "text": "Dua cangkir! Jadi dia sudah memaafkan anaknya. Itu makna tersiratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "294da3417903a8a5f6c9b143e91f435a479f826d367451e71e4f882d41c2b481",
      "text": "Penulis tidak menangis di cerita itu, tetapi isyaratnya jelas.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2994804ad3d62173579b7f53e48e471a50f34e9844f56d1bbf334fda8bb7fd32",
      "text": "mengesankan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2aa6de1c57c5da8662c16ef845572263a4a6ad3c79351bf3c5556c2343f9b6f3",
      "text": "Hujan dalam cerpen itu adalah simbol kesedihan, menurut saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c3281b08ad03c6fa2a27bd69b8ca5f553932c486ef04988d6388b86898faf4f",
      "text": "Konflik dalam cerpen itu tidak pernah diselesaikan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3581471a618f50b7876a7395231913f1971385cb628119a76f8109e99bfe257c",
      "text": "Barangkali dulu ada konflik. Dia takut ayahnya masih marah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3ae9b2c53ca807e4e7a0d7bbbe37970093350de0308b7b49ec2bb260d145a3a5",
      "text": "Dia tidak marah secara tersurat, tetapi dia menyindir.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b6125acd5e2484ef1bf9e0e9f04ffb4b64b0f8dd7d335a5ac6411d30452e063",
      "text": "rindu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3e7b87e98be031f9a60a8cdd9a46d425b36aabea7c1f860af156a7e39f2fb588",
      "text": "watak",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "474af7927cee5aa3341db52301fa04a3be63b3e76331c0407b0651b291451a7b",
      "text": "Amanat cerpen ini adalah bahwa keluarga selalu menunggu kita pulang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "47d344f0c9b4ecd9d4abd946f85c922d90742e9f3cdc50048c6bfac3831fc667",
      "text": "Anaknya merantau ke Jakarta sepuluh tahun yang lalu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "48319b20d2450865b63620083e8113cf5dc1fc0bf2ed1f3a939acce97b7a7383",
      "text": "tokoh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4a251693e75657e6950e1b65c56265f43abedb25c77448abbfaed565e53cbc9c",
      "text": "Lumayan saja? Wah, nenek pasti sedih mendengarnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4bf8af1257155089ddfd6da5511b700aa17d8a9d75959e187394df15ac012043",
      "text": "Gaya bahasa cerpen ini sederhana, tetapi sangat kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4eca2ee6fdc21dea5165d9f80b5b983baa817a2cb0a0e9bbf3191ceba1134cf5",
      "text": "Dia tidak menyindir secara tersurat, tetapi isyaratnya jelas.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4fa8c798cc9508fd08c8ca405cdb1f2a011b7607541bad3a75c90da78d887380",
      "text": "Ibu hanya diam, lalu kembali mengaduk teh yang sudah lama dingin.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "527672ed07c66e00338c0adb0355ad3544c220dd2507761d25ca4933fe4494d5",
      "text": "Jadi, Mohamed, apa tema cerpen \"Kursi di Teras\"?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "53614cb6d8bc70e1d6d291d895269fa900b32f12967c84074fb6610be40675d6",
      "text": "Gayanya campuran, ya. Ada Tionghoa, Melayu, dan Eropa.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "54cfac5d4f30fde312205536090532ece6a8944ffcaa7e04a9f58a337a53ba5d",
      "text": "Kalimat \"akhirnya terlalu cepat\"? Itu kritik yang sopan. Tidak apa-apa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5aa66cffc5c3daf3e08039c357d15f66617c47cc8c0d677ce4eb2284afe64400",
      "text": "Setiap pembaca bisa menafsirkan cerpen itu secara berbeda.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c12d94221b04c3ff21e22d368aa496598a0c086d2c542b22b3489eac2e80bd4",
      "text": "alur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c8036704c58c99be957dc759b566167be3c54ac86d7fe4cd8fd09787c1bc715",
      "text": "Terima kasih, Kak. Saya masih ragu dengan kalimat terakhir saya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5cd4731f6bb01e188ee305d49e4ab136f65db0c6c7ad56936670045fb607d966",
      "text": "cerpen",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d7dd35ca3f00d52a7610abc771f9afdbc237bc5472e50e2d9470dcf4f538ddb",
      "text": "Latar cerita itu sebuah kampung kecil di tepi Danau Toba.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "639e1c7f9ab3608395bac4b05efef46e2e9e63668875dcacd849ed7c8c74c228",
      "text": "Lumayan, Kak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "64c9f2f8352bc9a97d4eeee5a491ccf181fbbbadb8ee07b43c580a04271f6f2e",
      "text": "tersirat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "65f805ffcca1ec9c39d4916466d0fd6fa14b369b092827b5a8e106890ec2aeda",
      "text": "amanat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67374e6e2386b2619778323ecc92b960a032cb8475d6259746037f85c41f0305",
      "text": "Banyak orang Batak merantau, tetapi mereka tidak lupa kampungnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6bb74d56c751edc698d457a7e3ada60683d5a82ca5dbeef02dcc10ed12c0e057",
      "text": "Mohamed, saya baca ulasanmu tentang \"Kursi di Teras\". Bagus sekali!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7166cc1d542061c94ccaec130746e0e3802f611f0a45c6ae98d7da3e7aaebf7a",
      "text": "konflik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "735fdcde767f9a0eabff6ed25f8fe08e5ff1cff2a3c336fb633b3e707e7a2610",
      "text": "Ulasan Anda tentang cerpen itu sangat mengesankan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "75e13a7fb137938609f7d622c08827ec341c38482d6ffa0239c962a2f45d32c9",
      "text": "isyarat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7df21384e95d00765c578d0b020c030fd8e68c02dea619e984db6be991f7bf49",
      "text": "digambarkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "87468c8a30f86e315ab4a94f4ec29ca0d044002d0b179b88f1af26d22d98dca7",
      "text": "menyindir",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8ad697bae0cde2a81290f59ee1d6fd1b73284358c44be4a8c17573425c50e6b3",
      "text": "akhir terbuka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8e4fb15f94248929e00b49a2f39b2ad151865279be409ccce5de5aa72e1456ec",
      "text": "Rumah ini dibangun oleh Tjong A Fie, saudagar Hakka yang kaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8f0bf186806e28a2eb9d839294876dcaa63e5bc12e2028ac7022a3fe3569afa3",
      "text": "Alur dan tema cerpen itu sangat kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9347f2f69d8578e5e55dff3a2b772f5120acae117b6c5dd5829067c1cbbedcc9",
      "text": "menyentuh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "94174b437d2e3f6d1fe736634497a1d27deecb0017ae3ba8d05e48df518c7297",
      "text": "menafsirkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95041c0f962a9acffc37ebeb2f56d6283c35425954b2be1b83b2d6d839f19aab",
      "text": "tema",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9a116e85d478f1ef333191a1e5e5e9778cfe7f086671d5732380e4ae00f8b965",
      "text": "Dua-duanya bisa benar. Akhirnya kan terbuka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9bbf70608889872b4a62fdad89ade676c73f7f1a4654c9d52dd733d6394ba992",
      "text": "Lalu kalimat terakhir, \"Pak Lubis menuang teh ke dua cangkir.\"",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a1789ff91e228f36125cbc732dcacc451a5cb7029ae2cbd4fde7aad000544fed",
      "text": "Betul. Dia juga membantu membangun masjid dan kelenteng. Seperti cerpen, rumah ini punya makna tersirat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 104,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a61b66668a7dfff6c5bdf0351969e63d0fa5a09a169a853dfcdb846241f32379",
      "text": "Silakan, Mohamed. Kuenya enak? Ini buatan nenek saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aba10e19e566b66be3a0b9884aa0939f444bc81b6263fd6e4cabcf68f97cba85",
      "text": "Watak ayah itu keras, tetapi hatinya lembut.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b6b15ae9a56c0293a1d73e57351498365f4a3784bcebc0843ad8ade78293167e",
      "text": "Kalau begitu, telepon ibumu malam ini, Bang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bd20fa3910d12db8aee5a842fd2b5275e5583522abf3afe6ed52ead53f7c0b3a",
      "text": "Tema cerpen itu rindu, tetapi penulis tidak pernah menulis kata itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bdf3d2d51467899000ebc2b36f310c9912848ab24d53ef02ae618b0d9487c8b1",
      "text": "Syukurlah. Saya ingin jujur, tetapi tidak menyakiti penulisnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c76edebd535c34f5ab0866bec70d623fb50548418920d2e3928d3d896907ca3e",
      "text": "Betul. Saya juga anak rantau. Ibu saya di Samosir masih menunggu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ca8b6a4f9f73619463af037ccdf7f5a4ef480c7bb6f4d4a8a19ebd55fa50ce69",
      "text": "gaya bahasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd3cecb51ebc9ce7e7c638018937d3286b20c59232a84757c6ddbb622e91f5a6",
      "text": "Menurutmu, kenapa anaknya berdiri lama di pagar?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cef79ce06e704dc6b3eb079961c631c3abdc2c78bef21748f51fc5e53b5e2168",
      "text": "latar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d5c80adc0200777ba24e95d12a8326d04a87967d936cf317ba651c2b08d535c1",
      "text": "Amanatnya, Medan adalah rumah bagi semua orang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e2c2e7594693183e2d71ac11fd032b974a1c80d570a5be3dd5aae7d243c186df",
      "text": "Konflik cerita ini adalah antara ayah dan anak.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e367c7b842bbea64b2a3c3a09edf63d09a9f2152e717bd7fce10b2ab0fc88947",
      "text": "Setuju. Amanatnya tetap sama, keluarga selalu menunggu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e76b8d772017980fd3f12c67944fcdf0c1a22e8e04577eecdf3840cf9629029e",
      "text": "Tafsiranmu menarik, Bang. Tetapi bagi saya, hujan itu membersihkan, seperti awal yang baru.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 91,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee5a97b19d183caae0ee55d985a98049854367b3c60becf3f31771d2b1d6c452",
      "text": "Kalau dia bilang terserah, jangan langsung pergi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f2f2cc73bd622db31bce6e7a7e0502cbf00650a42e8a992063776b41a3de2f71",
      "text": "Menurut saya, rindu. Penulisnya tidak menulis kata \"rindu\", tetapi kursi kosong itu isyaratnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 95,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f337334aa71c21233f206da39d020f3794ee7ab5adcc16b9b327dcc357269896",
      "text": "simbol",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f67da47aa0203f1eac5ff248126bf3aec978659522a3f99d3a639ed5a11fbfba",
      "text": "Saya menafsirkan hujan itu sebagai simbol kesedihan ayah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f6c13d8d92d75bac24ec8b4cacdcb4b2fd03af20dcbc8359a635396bcf18e2d2",
      "text": "merantau",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
